WEBVTT

00:04:59.463 --> 00:05:00.630
Because, you know,

00:05:00.663 --> 00:05:04.597
if you can't feel confident
your child has the best education,

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:06.597
has access to a doctor,

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:09.763
pretty hard to be focused
on your business.

00:05:09.797 --> 00:05:12.097
And farming is a business.

00:05:12.130 --> 00:05:16.663
And so we have to recognize
if there's a number of hospitals,

00:05:16.663 --> 00:05:19.163
local hospitals have shut down,

00:05:19.197 --> 00:05:21.697
there's no banking,

00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:23.163
no housing.

00:05:23.497 --> 00:05:26.830
It doesn't work to have a stable
operating environment

00:05:26.830 --> 00:05:28.297
in these farming communities.

00:05:28.330 --> 00:05:33.463
And yes, directly, you cannot use
the new innovation and technology